  "releaseNotes": "Aggregate mock-invocation assertion: Then<TService>().WasInvoked(Times) (and .And<TService>().WasInvoked(...)) asserts a service's total invocation count; WasInvoked(Never) reads naturally as \"was not invoked\". Method-group form via `using static Moq.Times;` (WasInvoked(Once)/WasInvoked(Never)). Counts all invocations including property access",
